comments:
I did get this error during v9 prerendering after half a day to research tath 🤓 finally I figure out that error was due to `@Inject(WINDOW) private window: Window` in my custom directive:

```
import { WINDOW } from '@ng-toolkit/universal';
import { Directive, ElementRef, Attribute, OnInit, HostListener , Inject, Input} from '@angular/core';

@Directive({ selector: '[scrollTo]' })
export class ScrollToDirective implements OnInit {
  constructor(@Inject(WINDOW) private window: Window,  @Attribute('scrollTo') public elmID: string, private el: ElementRef) { }

  ngOnInit() { }

  //...
}
```

Error gets fixed by removing`@Inject(WINDOW) private window: Window` from `constructor` 

However in my other app in the same monorepo I am using the same directive and have no issues with that. The difference only that I am using that directive on a different html element. 🤔
